# ...but our first-party skill MEMORY.md files under .claude/ ARE version-controlled.
# (SKILL.md files are already tracked; only the loop-memory files need un-ignoring.
#  Narrowly re-include the dir traversal + MEMORY.md so other local/3rd-party skill
#  files in these dirs stay ignored.)
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/*/
!.claude/skills/*/MEMORY.md

